{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"连静静相伴都这样快乐，他忽然很想让对方知道，自己有多喜欢和对方待在一起。\",\n          \"key\": \"想让对方知道\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"话几乎要出口，他又怕对方此后难以自在；心里热得发紧，话停在嘴边。\",\n          \"key\": \"热切中的迟疑\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S03-1\",\n          \"rel\": \"提供理由\",\n          \"why\": \"他已经体会到安静相伴本身就令人快乐，所以此刻想让对方知道的，是连这样待着都让自己十分高兴。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"改写\",\n          \"why\": \"刚才想找话是为了多待一会儿；如今想说话的心思变了，他更想让对方明白自己有多在意。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"限制\",\n          \"why\": \"当初把心意留下，是怕说出来改变彼此的自在；如今真想表达时，这个顾虑又拦住了他。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"正在面对\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"安静相伴的快乐使他更想向对方表露心意，但说破后的变化仍令他迟疑。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 9,\n      \"why\": \"把上一段想找话的冲动推进为想表达在意，既解释了欢喜为何更热切，也解释了临近出口时的紧张与收敛。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选15\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"话头散了，他更专心体会两人安静待着的快乐，忽然想把这一会儿牢牢记住。\",\n          \"key\": \"想记牢此刻\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"想到这一会儿迟早只能靠回想重温，他心里猛地发酸；对方此刻仍在身边，又让他暖起来。\",\n          \"key\": \"提前舍不得\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"改写\",\n          \"why\": \"刚才他想用说话延长相处，又舍不得打断安静；那股想留住这一刻的心思，如今转成了想好好记住它。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"唤起\",\n          \"why\": \"先前他已在快乐中感到时间流走的酸楚；如今连安静相伴都想记牢，使他提前想到日后只能回味此刻，又被眼前仍有的亲近安慰。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"没在想\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始想把安静相伴的快乐留作日后回想。\",\n        \"他在相处仍然美好时，就已经会提前怀念这一刻。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"把先前想延长相处的愿望转成想保存记忆，能解释此刻格外丰盛的甜蜜、突然加深的不舍，以及随后仍被眼前亲近打动的温暖。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3c4c04df-1dcd-482d-ae8a-6928f158c611", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T153553029086Z", "elapsed_seconds": 407.282, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T15:42:40.314147+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ef58f6819c3a5ffd338022065fe488d2c167a112cc85e929d6cea5f47233bddd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T153553029086Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-of